  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "At Lang Ya blessed land, Lang Ya land spirit names Break Luck while explaining Connect Luck to Fang Yuan: Connect Luck links a Gu Master’s luck to another’s, sharing good or bad luck, and human luck rises and falls like a tide, so Break Luck is the Immortal Gu to use in tandem for that method.",
        "chapters": [
          663
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
          "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
          "gu_connect_luck",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_gu_master",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Lang Ya land spirit lists connect luck Immortal Gu, break luck Immortal Gu, and Divert Disaster Gu as part of the all living being’s luck true inheritance that had been inside Imperial Court blessed land. After that blessed land was destroyed, some of those Immortal Gu were sent outside, while the cultivation details were already lost.",
        "chapters": [
          1051
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "all-living-beings-luck",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_divert_disaster_immortal_gu",
          "loc_imperial_court_blessed_land"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Ying Wu Xie realizes Fang Yuan is using a luck path method through their Connect Luck link, he cannot break the luck connection. He does not have break luck Immortal Gu, so he tries soul path methods to interfere with the luck instead, one by one, without good effect. Fang Yuan reasons from the other end of the link that he holds the initiative while the luck stays connected, and that breaking the luck connection is exactly what he wants.",
        "chapters": [
          1153
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ying-wu-xie-cannot-break-the-connection",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_ying_wu_xie"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
